From 46f5b2b2121170abfd2b1864387d19943484d54d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seatree <none@none>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 23:33:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SEATREE local changes

NETCDFHOME handling for macOS in src/makefile and install-eqdyna.sh,
surface_coor.txt open/close fix in src/library_output.f90, directory
copying in scripts/create.newcase, per-panel png output in
scripts/plotRuptureDynamics (used by the SEATREE GUI), a single-rank
setup for case_input/test.tpv8, and build products added to .gitignore.
These were carried in the SEATREE tree (modules/seismo/EQdyna) and are
relative to 844cefe.
---
 .gitignore                                  |  4 ++
 case_input/test.tpv8/user_defined_params.py |  5 +-
 install-eqdyna.sh                           | 41 +++++++-----
 scripts/create.newcase                      |  8 ++-
 scripts/plotRuptureDynamics                 | 72 ++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/library_output.f90                      |  7 +-
 src/makefile                                | 22 +++++--
 7 files changed, 130 insertions(+), 29 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index 9bea433..ac91df4 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -1,2 +1,6 @@
 
